Package: wayoled
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: display protection daemon for wlroots-based Wayland compositors
 WayOLED reduces OLED burn-in risk and manages output brightness, gamma, and
 color temperature on wlroots-based Wayland compositors. It provides non-PWM
 dimming, time-of-day color temperature, a per-channel gamma curve, static
 content plus idle detection with automatic dimming, an on-demand
 pixel-refresh sweep, and backlight smoothing. The oledctl client controls a
 running daemon over a Unix socket.
